<title>NEW ZEALAND: Carter Holt to release H1 result Nov 7.</title>
<headline>Carter Holt to release H1 result Nov 7.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Carter Holt Harvey Ltd said on Thursday it would release its result for the six months to September 30 on November 7.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
